# Holding LB puts the Hotkeys layer over the profile; letting go brings the profile back.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/layers.padpack Base
tap south 30
press lb
tap south 30
tap east 30
release lb
tap south 30
---
key KEY_A down               @0
key KEY_A up                 @30
shifts mode - layers Hotkeys @30
key KEY_F1 down              @30
key KEY_F1 up                @60
key KEY_F2 down              @60
key KEY_F2 up                @90
shifts mode - layers -       @90
key KEY_A down               @90
key KEY_A up                 @120
